              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_BRGcRM": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is the return policy?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_h9y3Jg": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Pieces bought from the website can be returned within 14 days of delivery, unused and in their original condition and packaging. Personalised and made-to-order pieces are made for you and cannot be returned. Write to <a href=\"mailto:info@oberndoerferco.com\">info@oberndoerferco.com</a> with your order number and we will send the instructions; the full terms are in our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">return policy</a>.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_h9y3Jg"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_HmCHyF": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How long does delivery take?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_ziEjaq": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Pieces in stock are delivered within 7–14 days, free worldwide with DHL Express. Larger commissions are built to order: trunks take 2–6 months depending on complexity and personalisation, furniture and highly detailed commissions 4–6 months. We confirm exact timing once you have placed your order, or beforehand if you write to us.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
