                    "text": "<p>Write to <a href=\"mailto:info@oberndoerferco.com\">info@oberndoerferco.com</a> with your order number and your question; a person in the atelier answers. If you would like something not shown, a different leather, colour or lining, say so: most of what we make can be made to order.</p>",
