                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>It depends on what we are making. A small piece such as a leather box usually takes 4 to 6 weeks. Trunks take 2 to 6 months depending on complexity and personalisation. Sofas, furniture and highly detailed commissions take 4 to 6 months.</p><p>Each piece is made entirely by hand. We confirm a timeline with you before work begins and keep you informed as it progresses.</p>",
