              "blocks": {
                "text_7Dagz8": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our leather comes from tanneries in Italy, France and Germany, and is a byproduct of the meat industry. Exotic leathers follow a separate supply chain: the hides may originate outside Europe and are processed in Italy, always sourced and traded in full compliance with CITES, with documentation available on request.</p><p>For the leathers and hardware we use and how each piece is made, see <a href=\"/pages/materials-craftsmanship\">Materials &amp; Craftsmanship</a>.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
